@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SimSun
skinparam defaultFontSize 17
skinparam dpi 200
skinparam ArrowColor black
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor white
skinparam NoteBorderColor black
skinparam ActorBackgroundColor white
skinparam BoundaryBackgroundColor white
skinparam ControlBackgroundColor white
hide footbox
skinparam maxMessageSize 200
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam sequence {
 ParticipantBackgroundColor white
 ParticipantBorderColor black
 LifeLineBorderColor black
 LifeLineBackgroundColor white
 ArrowColor black
 GroupBackgroundColor white
 GroupBorderColor black
}
actor "收费人员" as A0
boundary "<u>:收费人员接口</u>" as B0
control "<u>:登记供应商付款</u>\n<u>与结算控制</u>" as K
participant "<u>:供应商资金</u>" as SupplierFunds
participant "<u>:供货付款</u>" as SupplyPayment
participant "<u>:采购差异</u>" as SupplyIssue
participant "<u>:供货退款</u>" as SupplyRefund
A0 -> B0 : 提交UC-29办理依据
activate B0
B0 -> B0 : 检查输入格式()
B0 -> K : 协调UC-29办理(对象、依据)
activate K
critical 本阶段关联结果共同生效
K -> SupplierFunds : 恢复供货办理(原付款办理及结果)
activate SupplierFunds
SupplierFunds -> SupplyPayment : 核实待定结果(渠道证据、实际金额)
activate SupplyPayment
SupplyPayment --> SupplierFunds : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate SupplyPayment
SupplierFunds --> K : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate SupplierFunds
K -> SupplyIssue : 提供确认退换(原采购或验收差异)
activate SupplyIssue
SupplyIssue --> K : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate SupplyIssue
K -> SupplierFunds : 确认供货退回款(原付款、退换依据和实际到账)
activate SupplierFunds
SupplierFunds -> SupplyRefund : 保留原款退款(金额、渠道、凭据)
activate SupplyRefund
SupplyRefund --> SupplierFunds : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate SupplyRefund
SupplierFunds -> SupplierFunds : 重算供货余额(预付、分配和退款)
SupplierFunds --> K : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate SupplierFunds
end
K --> B0 : 本阶段结果及下一步依据
deactivate K
B0 --> A0 : 展示结果、状态和原因
deactivate B0
note over K,SupplyRefund
校验不通过时返回规约中的原因；
本阶段不留下部分有效结果。
end note

@enduml
